---
import Photo from './Photo.astro';
import { problemChecks } from '../data/content';
---
<section class="section split" id="problem" aria-labelledby="problem-title">
  <div class="split-media">
    <Photo
      name="quiz-night"
      alt="A group of friends clinking pint glasses together across a pub table."
      sizes="(min-width: 60rem) 50vw, 100vw"
    />
  </div>
  <div class="split-copy">
    <h2 id="problem-title" class="h2">Most pub websites still show last summer’s quiz.</h2>
    <p class="intro">
      Before they visit, people check what’s on tonight, the food menu, opening hours and how to book.
    </p>
    <ul class="check-list" aria-label="What people check before they visit">
      {problemChecks.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
    </ul>
    <p>
      A stale site sends them to the pub down the road. Good pub web design keeps those answers right, every day.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
